  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Municipal Infrastructure Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objectives are to: (a) improve bulk potable water provision in target areas, and (b) assist municipalities to improve investment-planning capacity.  These objectives are in line with Bulgaria&apos;s National Strategy on Environment (2005-2014) which has a goal to provide good quality and sufficient quantity of water for various purposes.</narrative>
  </description>
